sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Client / User
    participant Gateway as FastAPI Router
    participant RBAC as Security Middleware (RBAC)
    participant Agent as LangGraph Orchestrator
    participant Tool as Restricted EHR Tool
    participant Audit as Immutable Audit Store
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    User->>Gateway: API Request with Bearer JWT
    Gateway->>RBAC: Validate Token & Extract Claims (sub, role, permissions)
    
    alt Token Invalid / Expired
        RBAC-->>User: 401 Unauthorized (Invalid credentials)
    else Token Valid
        RBAC->>RBAC: Check Required Permission vs Role (patient / staff / admin)
        
        alt Insufficient Privileges (e.g. Patient accessing Provider Override)
            RBAC->>Audit: Append Security Event (ACCESS_DENIED, role, endpoint, ip)
            RBAC-->>User: 403 Forbidden (Insufficient permissions)
        else Authorized
            RBAC->>Agent: Forward Request with Authenticated Context
            Agent->>Tool: Execute Intent (e.g. Book Slot / Read History)
            Tool->>DB: ACID Query with Patient Scoping Filter (patient_id)
            DB-->>Tool: Query Result
            Tool->>Audit: Log Authorized Action (ACTION_EXECUTED, role, tx_id)
            Tool-->>Agent: Tool Response
            Agent-->>User: 200 OK + Verified Response Payload
        end
    end
